scenario: new_country
A key used from the US for four days, past its 7-day learning period, is used from Germany: new_country, high. A second request from there is not new, and a third country is a repeat of the rule that only counts.

step 1  0h       app     request  198.51.100.7 US AS64500 openai-python/3
  nothing raised

step 2  24h      app     request  198.51.100.7 US AS64500 openai-python/3
  nothing raised

step 3  48h      app     request  198.51.100.7 US AS64500 openai-python/3
  nothing raised

step 4  72h      app     request  198.51.100.7 US AS64500 openai-python/3
  nothing raised

step 5  8d       app     request  198.51.100.7 DE AS64500 openai-python/3
